Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:10.72,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}抬起曾低下的头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:16.15,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}毒蛇在阴影之中袭击了所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.63,0:01:19.77,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}甚至无暇顾及其他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:21.47,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}但是你无法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:23.16,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:25.41,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:27.95,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}一旦有所犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:30.58,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}懈怠与焦虑也将再次来袭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.58,0:01:32.25,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:34.79,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.28,0:01:37.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}得到释放
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:38.33,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}必须夺回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:39.38,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}必须夺回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.62,0:01:39.84,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}哟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:41.68,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}这便是你之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:44.01,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}要倾听的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.35,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}这少年在之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:48.56,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}将倾听这节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.77,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}再度来袭锈迹斑驳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.22,0:01:53.10,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}冷热交替 无休无止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.32,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}要暗斗到何时？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:58.48,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}输掉决定性一击 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:00.45,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}但是你无法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:02.09,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}阻止这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.76,0:02:04.44,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}承受致命一击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:06.86,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}难以抑制的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:09.60,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2}热血与孤独沦为一片漆黑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.61,0:02:11.28,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}阻止这样的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.86,0:02:13.53,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}承受致命一击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:15.79,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}不论多少次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.25,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}必须夺回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.29,0:02:18.08,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\c&H272727&\1a&H00&\3c&HFEFEFE&\3a&H00&\bord1}必须夺回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:27.41,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}喪失に足る業が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:33.00,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}泡く日々に擦り切れても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.25,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H7B86AC&\3a&H00&}剥がれ落ちないよう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:39.25,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}合わせた掌ふたつ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:47.89,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}間 映し揺れる新しい光が在るから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:54.02,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}また投げ出して口衝いた僕の音が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:59.94,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}迸って 君に届くまで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:05.83,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}今 何千と言葉や意味を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:11.24,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}互い刻み合えるように
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:13.40,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}いつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.41,0:23:17.71,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}どうしようもなくて不確かで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:23.68,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}転がっていく運命を飲み干してく
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:29.52,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}ただ 口実や法則もないままで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:35.53,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}信じられることが全て
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:27.41,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}哪怕足以招致丧失的业果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:33.00,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}让我们在虚幻的日常中历经蹉跎消磨
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:35.25,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H7B86AC&\3a&H00&}仍不会让其轻易地剥离而下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.25,0:22:39.25,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}为此而合十了掌心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:47.89,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}黑暗中自会摇曳起一道新生的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.13,0:22:54.02,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}而后 我选择再次勇敢倾诉的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:59.94,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}在迸发后 企及你的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:05.83,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}如今 希望能将无数话语与真谛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:11.24,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}全都可以牢牢铭刻在彼此心间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:13.40,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}不论任何时候
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.41,0:23:17.71,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}哪怕一切令人束手无策难以确定
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:23.68,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}仍要将注定跌跌撞撞的宿命欣然接纳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.92,0:23:29.52,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}哪怕一切仍旧没有借口与规则可循
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:35.53,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2\3c&H82879C&\3a&H00&}我仍会坚信着所有的一切
